{"title":"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 48","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_48&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The area of a square inscribed in a semicircle is to the area of the square inscribed in the entire circle as: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/f/dff3f6c4dde1ad3637bd2a3d361f05bba05eff05.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 1: 2\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 2: 3\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 2: 5\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 3: 4\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 3: 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"470\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_48&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let the radius of the circle be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/e/7ae90d71491f591ab5a16d19ee7629e8226ec9ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"14\" height=\"10\" /> be the side length of the square inscribed in the semicircle and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/6/bb6c5ddfd368673c178f3323ce2994cdbc8fbdab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"14\" height=\"10\" /> be the side length of the square inscribed in the entire circle. For the square in the semicircle, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/c/1bc41252f605eeb33de1828d64eb3172b9314a67.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s_1^2 + (\\frac{s_1}{2})^2 = r^2 \\Rightarrow s_1^2 = \\frac{4}{5}r^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"216\" height=\"37\" />. For the square in the circle, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/0/1c0c72852da6260b85998a5a508a9c838f591507.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s_2 \\sqrt{2} = 2r \\Rightarrow s_2^2 = 2r^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"174\" height=\"21\" />.\n</p><p>Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/8/9a8b8cccb4c065056397506baac489bc4c4e39bb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s_1^2 : s_2^2 = \\frac{4}{5}r^2 : 2r^2 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 2: 5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"244\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_48&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME\" title=\"1951 AHSME\">1951 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1951 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1951\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_47\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 47\">Problem 47</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_49\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 49\">Problem 49</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=